<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian weekly forex demand falls to $44.345 mln.</title>
<headline>Nigerian weekly forex demand falls to $44.345 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's Central Bank on Thursday announced sales of forex at its latest weekly auction held on June 11:</p>
<p>						  11 June	   4 June</p>
<p> Amount sold			    $44.345 million $54.787 million</p>
<p> Dollar exchange rate		  85 naira	   85 naira</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
